## SQL Injection Prevention

- Use parameterized queries / ORM query builders **exclusively**.
- Never concatenate user input into SQL strings.
- In GORM: always use `?` placeholders or GORM's method chaining.

```go
// ✅ Safe — parameterized
db.Where("email = ? AND deleted_at IS NULL", userInput).Take(&user)

// ❌ DANGEROUS — never do this
db.Where("email = '" + userInput + "'").Take(&user)
db.Raw("SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = '" + userInput + "'").Scan(&user)
```

